; error: 12:26: expected type Light, got Lamp; Lamp imitates Light, so a value of Light goes where Lamp is expected, but not the other way: a value of Lamp may be a variant Light doesn't have, and a 'match' makes one from the other
kind Light
    Red
fi

kind Lamp::Light
    Off
fi

task main()
    fixed lamp: Lamp = Off
    fixed light: Light = lamp
    show(light)
fi
